# CI merge gate

When the user asks to open a PR or finish the branch, green CI authorizes land only if this PR’s critical path is exercised by what CI runs (`pytest` + coverage, `check_docs`, `render_status --check`). If not covered, add tests or get an explicit “merge anyway.” Do not weaken tests to manufacture a green badge.

**Authority:** [`CONTRIBUTING.md`](../../CONTRIBUTING.md) (CI merge gate). Test contracts: [`tests/README.md`](../../tests/README.md).
